80/rest/test_redirect_local_file/fcr:acl</a>&gt;; rel=\"acl\"</tt><br/>\n <tt>Location: <a href=\"http://localhost:8080/rest/test_redirect_local_file\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://localhost:8080/rest/test_redirect_local_file</a></tt><br/>\n <tt>Content-Type: text/plain</tt><br/>\n <tt>Content-Length: 51</tt><br/>\n <tt>Server: Jetty(9.3.1.v20150714)</tt><tt><a href=\"http://localhost:8080/rest/test_redirect_local_file\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://localhost:8080/rest/test_redirect_local_file</a></tt></p>\n\n<p> </p>\n\n<p>But then you can't get the file as the request hangs trying to follow the redirect and required (in my case) a Ctrl-C to exit.</p>\n\n<p> </p>\n\n<p><tt>&gt; curl -i <a href=\"http://localhost:8080/rest/test_redirect_local_file\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://localhost:8080/rest/test_redirect_local_file</a> -ufedoraAdmin:fedoraAdmin</tt><br/>\n <tt>HTTP/1.1 307 Temporary Redirect</tt><br/>\n <tt>Date: Fri, 29 Jun 2018 14:22:17 GMT</tt><br/>\n <tt>Set-Cookie: JSESSIONID=119fek7k909091czntsc38qt4i;Path=/</tt><br/>\n <tt>Expires: Thu, 01 Jan 1970 00:00:00 GMT</tt><br/>\n <tt>Set-Cookie: rememberMe=deleteMe; Path=/; Max-Age=0; Expires=Thu, 28-Jun-2018 14:22:17 GMT</tt><br/>\n <tt>ETag: \"359967083c14e82bbe3efec343b99a5607ede2e7\"</tt><br/>\n <tt>Last-Modified: Fri, 29 Jun 2018 14:20:56 GMT</tt><br/>\n <tt>Content-Type: image/tiff</tt><br/>\n <tt>Accept-Ranges: bytes</tt><br/>\n <tt>Content-Disposition: attachment; filename=\"\"; creation-date=\"Fri, 29 Jun 2018 14:20:56 GMT\"; modification-date=\"Fri, 29 Jun 2018 14:20:56 GMT\"; size=14761236</tt><br/>\n <tt>Link: &lt;<a href=\"http://www.w3.org/ns/ldp#Resource\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://www.w3.org/ns/ldp#Resource</a>&gt;;rel=\"type\"</tt><br/>\n <tt>Link: &lt;<a href=\"http://www.w3.org/ns/ldp#NonRDFSource\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://www.w3.org/n